= Chandrika Kumaratunge

Daughter of Sirimavo Bandaranaike and husband of movie star Vijaya Kumaratunge. Mrs Kumaratunge is a rising figure in the SLFP. She is on left of the split and has sympathies for the Tamil plight.

- @meditation
- @tamil
